window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"Creating Warriors,\" set in the early 19th century, is an enthralling tale of love, war, and supernatural intrigue. The story revolves around Beatrice, a headstrong young woman determined never to marry, and Abraham, a man who longs for supernatural powers. Their lives intersect in a Greek town where Abraham's father, seeking monetary gain, sells him to fight for Greece’s independence.</p> <p>The narrative weaves a complex plot involving Beatrice joining the military disguised as a man to be near Abraham, their separation due to war, and their eventual reunion under extraordinary circumstances. Beatrice and Abraham's love story unfolds amidst the backdrop of a larger conflict, where supernatural forces and prophecies play a crucial role.</p> <p>As the prophecy foretold by a witch starts to manifest, Beatrice and Abraham find themselves in the center of a cosmic battle. Beatrice, transformed into a powerful supernatural warrior, must navigate her new reality and the responsibility it brings. Meanwhile, Abraham discovers his shapeshifting abilities, adding a thrilling dimension to the conflict.</p> <p>Their journey is fraught with challenges, both external and internal, as they grapple with their destinies, loyalties, and the intense bond they share. \"Creating Warriors\" blends historical fiction with fantasy, offering a rich tapestry of characters, emotional depth, and a storyline that spans generations. It's a tale of love’s endurance through trials and the sacrifices made for a greater cause. This book is perfect for those who enjoy epic sagas that blend history, romance, and fantasy.</p>"; 
